<title>USA: AMX's Hardt to add chief executive title.</title>
<headline>AMX's Hardt to add chief executive title.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMX Corp on Wednesday said its president, Joe Hardt, will add the title of chief executive officer, effective July 1.</p>
<p>Scott Miller will remain as chairman of AMX, which produces integrated remote control systems.</p>
</text>
